nasty":"宋"}},{"title":"憩南屏","author":"释绍嵩","text":"窈窕阶除天一方，隔帘时有芰荷香。\n老僧瀹茗供清兴，不负西湖五月凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15871,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丈亭登舟有感","author":"释绍嵩","text":"未厌长为客，孤舟趁夜行。\n不唯山水乐，颇觉梦魂清。\n风缓帆舒卷，云行月送迎。\n劳生谁独免，空复叹劳生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15872,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与保宁西堂同客三塔因有感而作","author":"释绍嵩","text":"漫浪真堪老，君应与我同。\n旅怀斜日后，闲步淡烟中。\n有分长为客，无劳问转蓬。\n不妨留滞好，悟取本来空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15873,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口占","author":"释绍嵩","text":"江上有微径，渔人四五家。\n野船明细火，宿雁起圆沙。\n峡口闻猿夜，秋星见客槎。\n徘徊幽兴尽，更觉在天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15874,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]